| 2   | BL                      | Bill of Lading number                                                                    |
| 3   | Size                    | Container size or workbook-defined size value                                            |
| 4   | ShippingLine            | Shipping line                                                                            |
| 5   | DOCS RECEIVED DATE      | Date                                                                                     |
| 6   | DischargeDate           | Date                                                                                     |
| 7   | CarryIn Date            | Date                                                                                     |
| 8   | DODate                  | Date                                                                                     |
| 9   | AssessmentNotice        | Date or workbook-defined value; confirm against source                                   |
| 10  | ReleaseOrderPrintDate   | Date                                                                                     |
| 11  | PortCharges             | Treat as a date field based on workbook examples; confirm against actual source workbook |
| 12  | Allocation request date | Date                                                                                     |
| 13  | allocation date         | Date                                                                                     |
| 14  | DELAYS IN ALLOCATION    | Calculated field; formula must be verified                                               |
| 15  | Truck Number            | Text                                                                                     |
| 16  | LOADED                  | Preserve the workbook's data type and meaning                                            |
